==English==

===Etymology===
From {{af|en|loud|-ly}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈlaʊdli/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-loudly.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|er|more}}

# In a [[loud]] manner; at a [[high]] [[volume]].
#: {{ux|en|He spoke '''loudly''' so that his brother could hear him from across the street.}}
#: {{ant|en|quietly}}

